---
import { AGENDA } from "../../../lib/contact";
import StudioLayout from "../../../layouts/StudioLayout.astro";
import DerniersArticles from "../../../components/studio/DerniersArticles.astro";
---
<StudioLayout
  titre="Lab"
  description="What we build outside our missions: verifying what agents produce, and why it sits at the centre of our method."
  actif=""
  fil={[{ libelle: "Lab" }]}>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Lab</p>
    <h1>What we build outside our missions.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Our method rests on one promise: we measure what agents produce, instead of noting that they run. You still have to know how to do it. That&rsquo;s what we build here.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h2>Why it isn&rsquo;t a side project</h2>
    <p>Software that runs is not software that does what was expected of it. We can say that a program doesn&rsquo;t crash; we can rarely say what it does. That gap was already hard when humans wrote the code. It becomes the central problem now that part of it is produced by models.</p>
    <p>It&rsquo;s also what separates an automation that pays from one that costs. <strong>The work we do here isn&rsquo;t a product we sell you: it&rsquo;s the reason why, for our customers, we measure instead of assuming.</strong></p>

    <h2 style="margin-top:2em">What we publish</h2>
    <p>What we have understood, including when it cost us. We write what we would have wanted to read before starting. These articles appear on the blog, under the Lab tag.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid">
      <a class="card" href="/en/lab/harness/">
        <p class="who">Internal tool</p>
        <h3>Harness</h3>
        <p>The tool we are building to know what an automated process really does, and to be able to prove it. Open to a few teams we choose.</p>
        <span class="go">See the tool &rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<DerniersArticles etiquette="lab" titre="What we write about it" />

<section class="cta">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>More interested in your own processes?</h2>
    <p>45 minutes to talk them through. You leave with the list of your processes ranked by what they cost you.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn" href={AGENDA} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a call</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/en/method/">See the method</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</StudioLayout>
